h\">1</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A tanglefoot bag is filled with sticky substances. When you hit a creature with a tanglefoot bag, that creature takes a –15-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 minute. You gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls, and the Escape DC is 19 ([[/act escape dc=19]]).</p>\n<p>On a critical hit, a creature in contact with a solid surface becomes stuck to the surface and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round, and a creature flying via wings has its wings tangled, causing it to fall safely to the ground and become unable to Fly again for 1 round. Tanglefoot bags are not effective when used on a creature that is in water.</p>\n<p>The target can end any effects by Escaping or spending a total of 3 actions to carefully remove the sticky substances. These Interact actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can provide the actions as well.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":1,"invested":null},"expend":1,"group":"bomb","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":3},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":10}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"range":20,"reload":{"value":"-"},"rules":[{"key":"Note","outcome":["success"],"selector":"{item|_id}-attack","text":"PF2E.BombNotes.TanglefootBag.Moderate.success","title":"TYPES.Item.effect"},{"key":"Note","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-attack","text":"PF2E.BombNotes.TanglefootBag.Moderate.criticalSuccess","title":"TYPES.Item.effect"}],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"tanglefoot-bag-moderate","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["alchemical","bomb","consumable"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Jll4ZT9LeFqaL65P.HrAcx3zeQFN9A9Fb"},{"_id":"6tBRWwHl9GxlzMwB","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.hqMtsTwmOShdAdQW"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/flintlock-musket.webp","name":"Flintlock Musket","sort":300000,"system":{"ammo":{"baseType":"rounds-flintlock-musket","builtIn":false,"capacity":1},"baseItem":"flintlock-musket","bonus":{"value":0},"bonusDamage":{"value":0},"bulk":{"value":1},"category":"simple","containerId":null,"damage":{"damageType":"piercing","dice":1,"die":"d6"},"description":{"value":"<p>The most commonly available of firearms in Alkenstar, the flintlock musket includes an external firing mechanism and an efficient and relatively compact frame. Though lacking the range and firing power of the arquebus preferred by Alkenstar and Dongun Hold's military members, the flintlock musket is popular among civilians for its ease of use.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0,"invested":null},"expend":1,"group":"firearm","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":7}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Guns & Gears"},"quantity":1,"range":70,"reload":{"value":"1"},"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":0},"size":"med","slug":"flintlock-musket","splashDamage":{"value":0},"traits":{"rarity":"uncommon","value":["concussive","fatal-d10"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-two-hands"},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"weapon","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Jll4ZT9LeFqaL65P.6tBRWwHl9GxlzMwB"},{"_id":"JNbpFdpBxFCUgCKx","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.ewQZ0VeL38v3qFnN"},"img":"icons/equipment/chest/breastplate-layered-leather-studded-brown.webp","name":"Studded Leather Armor","sort":400000,"system":{"acBonus":2,"baseItem":"studded-leather-armor","bulk":{"value":1},"category":"light","checkPenalty":-1,"containerId":null,"description":{"value":"<p>This leather armor is reinforced with metal studs and sometimes small metal plates, providing most of the flexibility of leather armor with more robust protection.</p>"},"dexCap":3,"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","inSlot":true,"invested":null},"group":"leather","hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":0},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":3}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"size":"med","slug":"studded-leather-armor","speedPenalty":0,"strength":1,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"armor","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Jll4ZT9LeFqaL65P.JNbpFdpBxFCUgCKx"},{"_id":"bDituljDNQ33CED0","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.2RuepCemJhrpKKao"},"img":"icons/consumables/potions/bottle-round-corked-orante-red.webp","name":"Healing Potion (Minor)","sort":500000,"system":{"baseItem":null,"bulk":{"value":0.1},"category":"potion","containerId":null,"damage":{"formula":"1d8","kind":"healing","type":"vitality"},"description":{"value":"<p>A healing potion is a vial of a ruby-red liquid that imparts a tingling sensation as the drinker's wounds heal rapidly. When you drink a healing potion, you regain @Damage[1d8[healing]] Hit Points.</p>"},"equipped":{"carryType":"worn","handsHeld":0},"hardness":0,"hp":{"max":0,"value":0},"level":{"value":1},"material":{"grade":null,"type":null},"price":{"value":{"gp":4}},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook"},"quantity":1,"rules":[],"size":"med","slug":"healing-potion-minor","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["consumable","healing","magical","potion","vitality"]},"usage":{"value":"held-in-one-hand"},"uses":{"aut